# Authors

OpenTransition is the work of many people. This file records the lineage
of authorship; for the complete, up-to-date contributor list see the
GitHub contributors page:

<https://github.com/shelbeely/OpenTransition/graphs/contributors>

## Original author (TransTracks)

OpenTransition is a fork of **TransTracks**, written and maintained
single-handedly by **Cassie Wilson** (`<contact@transtracks.app>`) from
2018 to 2021. The TransTracks app was retired from the Google Play
Store in 2025, and its source repository is archived at:

<https://github.com/TransTracks/TransTracks-Android>

  Copyright © 2018-2021 TransTracks (Cassie Wilson)

We owe a deep debt of gratitude to Cassie. The bulk of the photo,
milestone, gallery, import/export, and database functionality in
OpenTransition originated in her work, and she chose to release it under
GPL-3.0-or-later — which is what made this fork possible at all.

## OpenTransition maintainers

  Copyright © 2025-2026 Shelbeely and OpenTransition contributors

- **Shelbeely** — project lead, fork maintainer
  ([github.com/shelbeely](https://github.com/shelbeely))

## Contributors

For the complete list of individuals who have contributed code,
documentation, translations, bug reports, or other improvements, please
see the GitHub contributors page linked above, plus the project's
`git log`.

## Reporting attribution issues

If you believe your contribution is not properly attributed, please
open an issue on the OpenTransition repository.
